    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man oþerne sace tihte, ⁊ he þane mannan mote an medle oþþe an þinge, symble se man þam oðrum byrigean geselle ⁊ þam riht awyrce þe to hiom cantwara deman gescrifen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person brings a charge against another in a matter, and he should meet that person in the assembly or in the public meeting, the person [charged] is always to give surety to the other and carry out that right which the judges of the Kentish people may appoint for them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man oþerne sace tihte, ⁊ he þane mannan mote an medle oþþe an þinge, symble se man þam oðrum byrigean geselle ⁊ þam riht awyrce þe to hiom Cantwara deman gescrifen.</ab>
      </div>
